Round-9 (Codex): 'worktree for' matched 'open a pull request from the worktree
for feature' and outranked ship's 'pull request' cue. Removed it; 'create a
worktree' already covers the legit 'create a worktree for this issue' case.
Ran an adversarial precision battery (PR/ship/validate/sonar/plan/review
near-misses + all should_trigger positives): every negative routes to its
correct non-worktree skill, every positive still resolves.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
